In vanilla, once you get an intrinsic, that
particular part of the game's threats aren't on your
list of constant worries any more.

Contrariwise, _not_ getting some intrinsics in
vanilla makes the late game incredibly difficult, as
the occasional postings about lacking magic
resistance late in the game document.

In spork, it seems, some of the intrinsics /
resistances "leak". and so you have more tedium in
the later game worrying about stuff that in vanilla
you can "earn" your way to being able to ignore so
you can concentrate on newer, more interesting
challenges.

